type: software
title: "Ashebo RGT Hamiltonian Reference Solver and Numerical Audit"
version: 0.1.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24407743"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Ashebo
    given-names: Yohannes Beyene
    affiliation: Ashebophysics
url: "https://ashebophysics.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YohannesAshebo/yohannes-ashebo-rgt-hamiltonian"
abstract: >-
  Reference source and reproducible numerical audits for the radial
  Relational Gap Theory counterflow Hamiltonian. Includes saved 256- and
  512-cell states, independent energy and gradient checks, heat-power
  accounting, and guarded grid-convergence analysis. This research preview
  preserves unresolved flux-direction and spatial-convergence findings.
keywords:
  - Hamiltonian
  - counterflow
  - numerical verification
  - Relational Gap Theory
  - reproducible research
